    "title": "Retiring federal judge accuses Trump of using law for partisan purposes - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By RAY LEWIS ,\n7 hours ago HUNT VALLEY, Md. (TNND) — A federal judge who retired last week has accused President Donald Trump of using the law for partisan purposes. Mark Wolf, a Massachusetts district court judge from 1985 to last Friday, said in an article for The Atlantic that he stepped away from the courtroom to speak out against Trump’s legal actions. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
